        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "――うぎゃあああああああ！\nこの辺一帯に邪気が漂ってます！",
            "enText": "Urrraaaagh! This malice!\nI feel malice all around me!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 4094677351338811597,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "ええと……どうしたの？\n突然……。",
            "enText": "Um… Is everything all right?\nThat was so sudden…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -1308454249878647342,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "いいから、今すぐそれを\n床に置いてください！",
            "enText": "There's no time! Quick, put what you're\nholding on the ground RIGHT NOW!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -6098906342459259328,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "え、この水を……？",
            "enText": "Huh? This water?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 6744075519484283299,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "大丈夫です！　スズカさんの今日の\nラッキーアイテムなので！",
            "enText": "That's right! That water bottle is your\nlucky item for today!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 9156339933554513949,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "つまり、スズカさんのラッキーが\n宿った水を床に置くことによって、\nそれが周辺に漂う邪気を浄化――",
            "enText": "If you place your lucky item on the ground,\nthe lucky energy will flow into the space\naround us and ——",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 8738255397281850360,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "ごくごくごく……。",
            "enText": "<i>Gulp…</i>",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 2414025075244916932,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "って、ぎゃああああああああー！\nなに飲んじゃってるんですか！",
            "enText": "Noooo! What are you doooing?!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 2585651299971299374,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "ふぅっ……え？\r\nあ、喉渇いてたからつい……。",
            "enText": "Phew… Huh? I was thirsty…",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -8691745360442873290,
            "blockIdx": 9
        }
    ],
